This time we set $n=5$. We randomly assigned five participants to an experimental group and a control group. Assume that we conducted a memory test on the experimental group after assigning them a certain cognitive task. The scores of the test are the numbers in the "value" column. Now, is there a difference between the mean values of the group that did the cognitive task and the group that did not?

